// T8.3 & T8.3b — Comprehensive unit tests for `tools/verifier` (Blueprint Sections 6.5, 6.8).
// Covers:
// - Real CIP-30 `signData` (COSE_Sign1 + COSE_Key) generated by pinned `@meshsdk/core` 1.9.1 `MeshWallet`
//   using an ephemeral in-memory testnet mnemonic (never committed, no real funds).
// - Real-shaped Blockfrost OpenAPI JSON responses (`/blocks/latest`, `/txs/{hash}`,
//   `/txs/{hash}/utxos` with `collateral`/`reference`, `/txs/{hash}/required_signers` with `witness_hash`)
//   run through the real `createBlockfrostChainReader`.
// - Full-view cross-checks, fallback label status, shallow tx UNVERIFIABLE vs 404 REJECTED,
//   malformed/null 200 JSON responses, fixed known-answer commitment vector, and all 35 mutations.

